            "review_text": "Shore Excursion... V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1662 contributions\n0\nHighly recommended\nNov 2024 • Friends\nWe came and tasted Banh Canh Cua here. Very good noodle soup served with shrimp, crab meat and balls. Located at small shop, no aircond mostly served local people. They are off twice a month: 1st and 15th (lunar calender).\nWritten November 19, 2024",
